{"id": "20533199", "revid": "44217690", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20533199", "title": "Wyoming Highway 240", "text": "Wyoming Highway 240 (WYO 240) is a state road that in Lincoln County, Wyoming that connects U.S. Route 30 (US 30) and US 189 in the southeastern end of the county.\nRoute description.\nWyoming Highway 240 is a north\u2013south highway that runs from US 30 in Opal north to a north end at US 189 located approximately northeast of Kemmerer. WYO 240 Acts as a bypass for travelers connecting from US 30 west to US 189 north."}
