{"id": "20535517", "revid": "35936988", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20535517", "title": "Maclean Strait", "text": "Maclean Strait () is a natural waterway through the Canadian Arctic Archipelago in the territory of Nunavut. It separates the Findlay Group (to the south-west) from Ellef Ringnes Island and King Christian Island (to the north-east)."}
