{"id": "20536032", "revid": "45417033", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20536032", "title": "Maguse Lake", "text": "Maguse Lake is a lake in Kivalliq Region, Nunavut, Canada. It drains eastward into Hudson Bay by way of the long Maguse River. The area is frequented by caribou. A fifteen-year project building a road to Maguse Lake from Arviat was completed in 2010."}
