{"id": "20536158", "revid": "753665", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20536158", "title": "Aeronautical Engineering Review", "text": "Aeronautical Engineering Review was a journal published by the Institute of the Aeronautical Sciences.\nHistory.\nThe Institute of the Aeronautical Sciences started on 1933. It was titled the \"Journal of the Aeronautical Sciences\". It became a monthly publication in 1935. The journal contained a section called \"News from the Institute\", that contained meeting notices, announcements, and obituaries. By 1944 this information was transferred to the Aeronautical Engineering Review."}
